WEBVTT

00:08.967 --> 00:10.760
[running footsteps]

00:10.844 --> 00:12.971
- [Gotak] Hey, m-m-m-m-move. Move.
- [boy 1] Whoa.

00:14.597 --> 00:15.598
Hey, Si-eun!

00:18.685 --> 00:20.645
You're staying here? Really?

00:22.897 --> 00:24.149
- Uh-huh.
- [hands clap]

00:24.232 --> 00:25.692
- Yes!
- [laughing]

00:26.735 --> 00:28.737
Ha! [chuckles]

00:28.820 --> 00:30.697
I heard Hu-min joined the Union.

00:31.865 --> 00:33.366
He's not answering his phone.

00:39.539 --> 00:40.707
It's because of us, right?

00:42.125 --> 00:43.668
He felt bad for us.

00:45.670 --> 00:48.423
He thought everything
that happened to us was his fault.

00:52.802 --> 00:53.803
But still,

00:55.555 --> 00:56.848
we should go get him.

00:58.349 --> 01:00.226
[tense music playing]

01:00.310 --> 01:01.895
- [laughter]
- [Dong-ha] Hey, Baku.

01:01.978 --> 01:03.730
Baek-jin said be quick and come back.

01:05.940 --> 01:09.027
[boy 1] Is that him? From Hyeongshin?
He's a fucking poser.

01:09.527 --> 01:10.779
[boy 2] Is it cold in here?

01:11.696 --> 01:13.198
[boy 1] He's so fuckin' tall.

01:14.532 --> 01:16.367
[boy 3] What the heck
is wrong with his eyes?

01:16.868 --> 01:18.495
[boy 1] He's trying to be tough!

01:18.995 --> 01:20.163
Give me a cigarette.

01:21.372 --> 01:22.749
[all] Ooh!

01:23.625 --> 01:25.168
[all] Whoa! Oh!

01:25.251 --> 01:27.545
- [laughter]
- [boy 1] Hey, Baku's gettin' beat.

01:27.629 --> 01:30.006
- [boy 4] Whoa, he's strong.
- [boy 5] Yeah.

01:30.715 --> 01:32.759
He's been workin' out, right? [chuckles]

01:34.094 --> 01:35.512
- Aah!
- You done?

01:36.346 --> 01:38.348
[tense music playing]

01:39.057 --> 01:40.100
[scoffs]

01:40.809 --> 01:41.768
Shut up.

01:41.851 --> 01:43.394
[grunts]

01:43.478 --> 01:45.021
- [boy 6] Fuck.
- [boy 4] Shit.

01:47.398 --> 01:49.400
[coughing]

01:51.444 --> 01:54.030
- [grunts]
- [boy 7 gasps] We're fucking screwed.

01:54.114 --> 01:55.448
What are we gonna do?

02:03.957 --> 02:06.334
- [boy 4] Hey, yo, yo, yo.
- [boy 1] All right, okay. All right.

02:06.417 --> 02:09.254
- [boy 4] It's over, come on.
- [boy 1] It's over, it's over. Stop.

02:14.175 --> 02:15.218
Why?

02:18.263 --> 02:19.264
What?

02:26.020 --> 02:28.106
[music fades]

02:29.440 --> 02:31.442
["Hero" by Meego playing]

02:46.082 --> 02:48.835
WEAK HERO:
CLASS 2

03:49.854 --> 03:51.064
[Baek-jin] Great work.

03:52.941 --> 03:53.942
[scoffs]

04:15.546 --> 04:16.714
Huh.

04:18.675 --> 04:19.676
What is this?

04:22.637 --> 04:23.930
Give it to your dad.

04:27.016 --> 04:28.851
Are you a fucking charity worker?

04:29.978 --> 04:33.147
I told you before,
he'll have to pay a fine.

04:37.568 --> 04:38.861
[Baku] You're giving me this

04:41.698 --> 04:43.783
to make me do worse shit, aren't you?

04:46.077 --> 04:47.870
[Baek-jin] I know you'll take it anyway.

04:50.081 --> 04:52.041
Does saying that make you feel better?

04:55.336 --> 04:56.504
[Baku] How did you…

04:59.966 --> 05:01.634
end up the way you are?

05:04.262 --> 05:06.264
[poignant music playing]

05:13.104 --> 05:14.689
[Dong-ha] Where you going, Baku?

05:17.567 --> 05:18.901
What's his problem?

05:19.819 --> 05:21.404
[door slams]

05:27.493 --> 05:30.079
[grunting, blows landing]

05:42.967 --> 05:43.968
Shithead.

05:45.595 --> 05:48.306
Hey, hey, hey! Na Baek-jin!

05:48.389 --> 05:50.433
Enough! That's enough!

05:51.225 --> 05:52.769
Don't beat him to death!

05:54.354 --> 05:55.855
Why stop it?

05:56.814 --> 05:59.150
[scoffs] I learned it all from you.

06:08.618 --> 06:09.577
[sighs]

06:22.131 --> 06:24.133
[all breathing heavily]

06:27.220 --> 06:29.055
It must be tough for Baku

06:29.931 --> 06:31.432
to climb this every day.

06:33.643 --> 06:34.811
That's why Baku's got

06:35.728 --> 06:38.231
the highest freakin' stamina
I've ever seen.

06:38.314 --> 06:39.899
- [Jun-tae] Right.
- [Gotak sighs]

06:43.152 --> 06:44.112
Hey, Baku!

06:47.573 --> 06:48.658
Hey, Park Hu-min!

06:51.828 --> 06:53.579
I told you he wouldn't be here.

06:55.790 --> 06:57.583
[Jun-tae] Where the heck could he be?

06:59.544 --> 07:00.711
Hey, brats.

07:02.755 --> 07:03.631
Why are you here?

07:04.757 --> 07:05.925
[Jun-tae] Hello.

07:12.974 --> 07:14.475
Sir, have you been doing well?

07:16.477 --> 07:18.187
Hmm. How do you think?

07:23.484 --> 07:24.610
Why are you here?

07:25.611 --> 07:26.529
Ah, well…

07:27.029 --> 07:30.658
How long since Hu-min's been here?
Has it been a while?

07:32.577 --> 07:35.580
[Jin-cheol sighs] I should've
beat more sense into him.

07:36.372 --> 07:38.458
That brat's a total nutcase. Okay?

07:39.459 --> 07:40.835
He's just like his mother.

07:40.918 --> 07:43.129
I can never tell
what the hell he's thinking.

07:43.671 --> 07:46.215
Hey, when you see that brat,

07:46.299 --> 07:48.050
tell him to either die out there

07:48.551 --> 07:50.344
or come home and learn how to fry chicken.

07:51.137 --> 07:53.389
He's such a goddamn idiot.

07:54.682 --> 07:58.060
Did Hu-min… do something awful to you?

08:01.022 --> 08:02.231
What?

08:03.316 --> 08:06.777
Hu-min is neither a nutcase

08:07.528 --> 08:09.113
nor an idiot at school.

08:10.448 --> 08:12.366
He cares a lot about his friends,

08:12.950 --> 08:14.702
and everyone really likes him.

08:16.496 --> 08:17.914
I don't think it's him.

08:19.081 --> 08:20.541
Hu-min is a great guy.

08:21.292 --> 08:23.169
You seem to be the problem, sir.

08:26.297 --> 08:27.507
This little son of a…

08:31.427 --> 08:32.428
Leave.

08:34.138 --> 08:35.431
Get out of here!

08:37.517 --> 08:39.310
- Yes, sir.
- Get out!

08:39.393 --> 08:40.436
Let's go.

08:41.270 --> 08:42.480
Please excuse us.

08:42.563 --> 08:43.481
[Gotak] Ugh!

08:43.564 --> 08:45.775
See? I told you
we shouldn't have gone there.

08:47.068 --> 08:50.863
Whenever Baku's dad was drunk,
he used to sleep at my place.

08:51.948 --> 08:53.658
[Jun-tae] He was really scary.

08:56.285 --> 08:57.411
I'm wondering…

08:58.496 --> 09:00.331
why Na Baek-jin needs Hu-min?

09:03.417 --> 09:05.044
You said they used to be friends, right?

09:05.753 --> 09:08.631
Mm-hmm. They were freaking BFFs before.

09:10.591 --> 09:12.635
Na Baek-jin used to be a legit nerd.

09:13.886 --> 09:16.097
Couldn't even look other kids in the eye.

09:19.016 --> 09:20.017
And then?

09:23.813 --> 09:25.815
Baku taught Na Baek-jin
everything he knew.

09:26.566 --> 09:27.650
About fighting.

09:30.319 --> 09:32.196
[poignant music playing]

09:32.280 --> 09:37.785
I decided, never again am I ever
gonna teach anybody else how to fight.

09:50.923 --> 09:51.966
[school clock chiming]

09:52.049 --> 09:53.968
- [boy] Hey, it's lunchtime!
- [students clamoring]

09:54.051 --> 09:56.387
EUNJANG HIGH SCHOOL

10:00.516 --> 10:01.684
[sighs]

10:01.767 --> 10:04.145
[Si-eun] You know Park Hu-min
joined the Union, right?

10:05.229 --> 10:06.397
[Hyo-man] So what?

10:08.482 --> 10:11.110
I don't know where he is. Any idea?

10:11.193 --> 10:13.154
[Hyo-man] How the hell should I know?

10:13.237 --> 10:15.448
And even if I knew, why would I tell you?

10:15.948 --> 10:18.576
[Gotak sighs] I'm hearing some attitude.

10:19.619 --> 10:21.787
Hey, tell us before we get mean.

10:21.871 --> 10:24.624
Fuck you!
You're just Baku's minion, you shithead.

10:24.707 --> 10:26.334
You wanna fucking go? Huh?

10:26.959 --> 10:27.960
[gasps]

10:29.378 --> 10:30.212
[sighs]

10:32.923 --> 10:33.924
Okay.

10:34.967 --> 10:36.010
My bad.

10:38.512 --> 10:40.139
Just tell us. Where's Baku?

10:42.141 --> 10:44.810
Asshole. You're nothing.

10:47.563 --> 10:48.898
Well, you know that place.

10:48.981 --> 10:52.902
He's probably at Daesung Motorcycle
or polishing bowling balls, okay?

10:52.985 --> 10:54.904
- [yawns]
- Daesung?

10:54.987 --> 10:55.905
[Hyo-man sighs]

10:55.988 --> 10:58.824
[scoffs] You don't even know that? God.

11:00.409 --> 11:01.577
[grunts]

11:03.162 --> 11:04.163
Well…

11:05.456 --> 11:06.957
First, the bowling alley.

11:08.959 --> 11:10.628
[squealing and cheering]

11:11.295 --> 11:14.090
- [girl 1] Wow, great! Me, me, I'm next!
- [boy 1] Nice! Hey, what now?

11:15.091 --> 11:18.052
[Hyo-man] Na Baek-jin works
as a manager at the bowling alley.

11:18.552 --> 11:21.013
- But that place just launders money.
- Welcome, sir.

11:21.097 --> 11:22.932
- [Si-eun] Launders?
- [Hyo-man] Money laundering.

11:23.015 --> 11:23.891
OWNER: CHOI CHANG-HEE

11:24.475 --> 11:27.728
[Hyo-man] The owner is some thug,
so he uses that place as a front.

11:27.812 --> 11:31.440
He manipulates sales
and hires the Union guys as part-timers

11:31.524 --> 11:32.983
to blow up their pay, on paper.

11:36.070 --> 11:38.322
The profit he makes
from Daesung is illegal,

11:38.406 --> 11:40.866
so he launders everything
he gets from there too.

11:40.950 --> 11:42.034
[counting machine whirs]

11:42.118 --> 11:44.078
What does he do at Daesung Motorcycle?

11:45.871 --> 11:47.206
These crazy-ass pricks

11:48.791 --> 11:51.836
steal everything from delivery
motorcycles, motor scooters,

11:51.919 --> 11:53.879
to basically any kind of bike
you can think of.

11:55.214 --> 11:57.341
Then, they change the license plates,

11:57.425 --> 11:59.927
repaint them,
and even change the motorcycle parts

12:00.010 --> 12:02.763
to turn them into
unregistered vehicles and sell them.

12:03.264 --> 12:07.810
But before that, they also create a list
of literally everything for themselves.

12:11.564 --> 12:13.232
And when it's time, they check the list,

12:13.315 --> 12:17.027
use the copies of the keys they've
already made, and steal everything back.

12:18.028 --> 12:21.198
Wait, that makes no sense. They would've
called the police if that happened.

12:21.282 --> 12:23.409
Police? You dumbass.

12:23.492 --> 12:25.494
Hey, how would they make a report?

12:25.578 --> 12:27.997
They only sell by cash
or burner bank accounts.

12:28.080 --> 12:30.624
And the business has also
gotta be tied to thugs

12:31.500 --> 12:35.504
because apparently the police always
seem to turn a blind eye to all this.

12:36.922 --> 12:39.383
Why do the Union guys work for Baek-jin?

12:39.467 --> 12:41.260
Hey, bro, it's so simple.

12:41.844 --> 12:44.555
It's 'cause he pays them good coin.
Think about it, bro.

12:44.638 --> 12:47.349
They make a couple million won
just by running fucking errands.

12:47.433 --> 12:49.810
That's why these dumbasses
just lose their minds.

12:49.894 --> 12:52.521
It makes sense.
You know Baku's dirt-ass poor.

12:52.605 --> 12:56.066
You wanna die? You don't know
fucking shit about him, asshole.

12:57.902 --> 12:59.111
[Si-eun] Let's leave.

13:01.280 --> 13:02.281
Hey.

13:03.657 --> 13:07.036
What are you up to? Are you gonna
go beat up Baek-jin or somethin'?

13:07.787 --> 13:09.205
[chuckles]

13:15.002 --> 13:19.673
It's just that I also have
some unresolved business.

13:19.757 --> 13:22.802
So why don't we all fucking team up, yeah?

13:22.885 --> 13:26.055
Then, when he's all alone, yeah,
all alone, we can beat him up.

13:26.847 --> 13:28.432
Let's find him together and kick his ass.

13:28.516 --> 13:30.017
Hey, I should make some calls?

13:30.100 --> 13:35.022
Hey, Si-eun-a. Hey, I should round up
my boys right now or something? Huh?

13:37.107 --> 13:38.484
We don't need your help.

13:40.194 --> 13:41.070
Huh?

13:43.989 --> 13:45.699
[Gotak sighs] What a dumbass.

13:48.202 --> 13:49.328
[Hyo-man sighs]

13:56.126 --> 13:57.336
What?

13:59.755 --> 14:00.798
[mimicking] "What?"

14:05.177 --> 14:06.178
[gasps]

14:08.389 --> 14:10.224
[Gotak] Should we grab
one of those Union guys

14:10.307 --> 14:12.852
and get the address
of Daesung Motorcycle out of him?

14:13.644 --> 14:16.105
I have a pretty good feeling
that Baku will be there.

14:23.737 --> 14:26.866
And do what? Start a fight and get hurt?

14:29.076 --> 14:30.327
Nothing like that.

14:32.705 --> 14:34.248
Don't plan anything yet.

14:36.166 --> 14:37.751
I have something in mind.

14:38.836 --> 14:40.004
Please wait.

14:43.632 --> 14:46.927
Huh. Can you at least tell us
what you're thinking?

14:48.053 --> 14:49.763
You expect us to just sit here?

14:50.723 --> 14:53.475
Man, you don't even know
where Baku is or what he's doing.

14:56.061 --> 14:57.187
[sighs]

14:58.022 --> 14:59.023
Whatever.

14:59.648 --> 15:01.150
[door opens]

15:03.611 --> 15:04.737
[door closes]

15:23.547 --> 15:27.051
USE THIS

15:28.677 --> 15:29.845
[sighs]

15:30.512 --> 15:31.764
[phone alert buzzes]

15:38.896 --> 15:40.439
BAEK-JIN SENT A PHOTO

15:40.522 --> 15:42.942
76 YEONGDEUNGPO-RO 10-GIL,
YEONGDEUNGPO-GU, SEOUL

15:44.318 --> 15:46.111
[tense music playing]

15:51.700 --> 15:53.702
[phone buzzing]

15:59.833 --> 16:00.834
What is this?

16:02.211 --> 16:03.963
Something for you to go get.

16:07.341 --> 16:08.342
What?

16:09.218 --> 16:10.219
[Baek-jin] Steal it

16:11.345 --> 16:13.681
if you want to protect
the people in your life.

16:13.764 --> 16:14.765
[hangs up]

16:26.443 --> 16:33.450
AWARD FOR OUTSTANDING ACADEMIC ABILITY
SOPHOMORE, NA BAEK-JIN

16:33.534 --> 16:35.411
[tense music continues]

16:39.581 --> 16:40.749
[Baku] We're just…

16:43.627 --> 16:44.878
childhood friends.

17:02.855 --> 17:05.024
Fucking bullshit, man.

17:05.774 --> 17:08.068
You can't organize those, you idiot.

17:08.152 --> 17:10.904
- Why not?
- Ugh, it's not worth it.

17:10.988 --> 17:12.406
- It's okay.
- [boy 1 sighs]

17:12.489 --> 17:14.658
[boy 2] Hey, isn't he that kid?

17:15.284 --> 17:16.910
- [boy 3] What?
- [boy 1] What kid?

17:16.994 --> 17:18.078
[boy 2] One sec.

17:19.496 --> 17:20.330
Hey.

17:21.123 --> 17:22.124
What's up?

17:23.667 --> 17:25.127
[Si-eun] Where's Na Baek-jin?

17:25.836 --> 17:26.837
[boy 1] Huh.

17:27.921 --> 17:29.048
Hyeong!

17:35.804 --> 17:38.307
- That kid is looking for Baek-jin hyeong.
- Why?

17:38.807 --> 17:42.019
Oh, he's the asshole
that beat up Geum Seong-je.

17:44.021 --> 17:44.980
[Dong-ha] That guy?

17:45.689 --> 17:46.774
[laughs]

17:47.733 --> 17:51.320
Hey, are you the freaking nutcase
who beat up Seong-je?

17:51.403 --> 17:52.654
[chuckles]

17:52.738 --> 17:55.365
Damn, I've been so curious about you, man.

17:56.658 --> 17:58.494
Pleasure's mine. Gimme your hand.

17:59.578 --> 18:00.788
Where's Na Baek-jin?

18:01.997 --> 18:02.998
[laughs]

18:05.876 --> 18:07.252
Why do you ask?

18:08.837 --> 18:10.422
I have something to tell him.

18:11.465 --> 18:12.633
But nothing to say to you.

18:17.721 --> 18:19.014
[laughs]

18:20.557 --> 18:21.975
He must be insane.

18:24.269 --> 18:26.396
Well, Baek-jin will be here soon,

18:26.480 --> 18:27.815
so stick around.

18:28.315 --> 18:30.359
You can play some games if you get bored.

18:31.276 --> 18:33.445
Turn the signs off.
Business is closed today.

18:33.529 --> 18:34.530
[boy 1] Yes, sir.

18:37.825 --> 18:39.785
DAESUNG CORPORATION

18:39.868 --> 18:42.788
[Jun-tae] Tak-a, should we
really be doing this?

18:43.288 --> 18:45.499
[Gotak] Let's just try
looking for him, okay?

18:47.126 --> 18:49.294
[Jun-tae] I think this is the right place.

18:51.547 --> 18:52.840
[Gotak] This way?

18:52.923 --> 18:55.843
[Jun-tae] No, I think this is it.
Daesung Corporation.

18:55.926 --> 18:57.678
YEONGJIN INDUSTRIES

18:57.761 --> 18:59.555
[Gotak] Then we can just go in.

18:59.638 --> 19:01.390
- Come on.
- [Jun-tae] Hey, wait. One second.

19:01.890 --> 19:04.935
- [Gotak] Is this right?
- [Jun-tae] I don't see Daesung Motorcycle.

19:05.018 --> 19:08.063
But this is the only place that
came up for Daesung Corporation.

19:08.147 --> 19:11.984
But wait, don't you think
we should listen to what Si-eun said?

19:12.067 --> 19:16.196
Hey, you think Baku will show up
if we stand around and wait?

19:19.241 --> 19:20.701
We have to do something.

19:23.245 --> 19:24.621
[Jun-tae sighs nervously]

19:25.789 --> 19:26.957
[Gotak] Huh?

19:28.917 --> 19:29.751
[Jun-tae] Hey!

19:30.919 --> 19:34.089
One second. Hey. Hey, go slow. Slow, slow.

19:34.756 --> 19:35.799
[grunts]

19:36.508 --> 19:37.843
[gasps] Whoa.

19:37.926 --> 19:40.929
- There are a ton of motorcycles.
- [Gotak] There are? Hah!

19:41.513 --> 19:43.015
Hold on a bit. [grunts]

19:43.098 --> 19:44.266
- [grunts]
- [Gotak groans]

19:44.349 --> 19:46.518
Damn it. Why are you so heavy?

19:47.519 --> 19:48.604
Man, you're freaking heavy.

19:48.687 --> 19:50.731
[Jun-tae] Hey, I see the sign
for Daesung Corporation.

19:50.814 --> 19:51.857
- This is it.
- [Gotak] It is?

19:51.940 --> 19:53.233
- I'm pretty sure.
- [Gotak] It is?

19:53.317 --> 19:54.818
- Yeah.
- [Gotak grunts]

19:55.861 --> 19:57.112
[groans]

19:58.197 --> 20:01.491
- [Jun-tae] Are you okay?
- Yeah. Oh, I'm fine. You saw it?

20:01.575 --> 20:03.827
Uh-huh, I saw it. The signboard
said "Daesung Corporation."

20:03.911 --> 20:06.955
Okay, great job.
Then we can just wait, I guess.

20:07.039 --> 20:10.000
I'm sure that Baku will either
come out or go in if we wait.

20:10.834 --> 20:11.710
- Nice.
- Thanks.

20:11.793 --> 20:12.669
- Okay.
- Okay.

20:12.753 --> 20:14.546
- Nice.
- [both chuckle]

20:14.630 --> 20:18.967
WESTERN SEOUL HIGH SCHOOLS' UNION
ROADS WITHOUT CCTV

20:25.224 --> 20:26.475
[sighs]

20:43.075 --> 20:45.077
[tense music playing]

20:58.840 --> 21:00.842
[phone buzzing]

21:05.973 --> 21:09.101
GOTAK

21:15.524 --> 21:17.067
[sighs]

21:17.150 --> 21:19.152
[ringing tone]

21:21.029 --> 21:23.532
- [recording] The number you have dialed…
- [sighs]

21:24.574 --> 21:25.617
[Jun-tae] No answer?

21:27.202 --> 21:28.120
[Gotak] No.

21:30.247 --> 21:31.248
That asshole.

21:31.748 --> 21:32.624
[sighs]

21:32.708 --> 21:33.750
[bleeps]

21:34.376 --> 21:37.713
[recording] The number you have dialed
is not available. Please leave a mess--

21:37.796 --> 21:39.047
Goddamn sick of this shit.

21:39.131 --> 21:40.757
- What?
- [sighs]

21:42.217 --> 21:43.218
[sighs]

21:45.846 --> 21:47.806
[suspenseful music playing]

21:52.728 --> 21:53.729
[Jun-tae] Wait!

21:54.688 --> 21:56.940
Wh… why are you doing this? Huh?

22:03.155 --> 22:04.239
Hey, hey, hey.

22:06.074 --> 22:08.285
Hey, Park Hu-min! I know you're in there!

22:09.786 --> 22:10.912
Come out!

22:10.996 --> 22:12.414
Hey, the Union guys might be inside.

22:12.497 --> 22:14.958
Why would they be in there?
Nobody's walked by in hours.

22:15.042 --> 22:16.168
[gasps]

22:16.752 --> 22:17.753
Hey, Baku!

22:18.503 --> 22:20.505
Park Hu-min! Hey, Baku!

22:21.006 --> 22:22.090
I don't think he's inside.

22:22.174 --> 22:24.801
Let's leave and think
about this later, Tak-a. Okay?

22:24.885 --> 22:26.053
[exhales]

22:26.678 --> 22:27.804
Let's go inside.

22:29.473 --> 22:31.475
Go in there, for real? What?

22:31.558 --> 22:32.642
[gasping]

22:32.726 --> 22:35.812
W… wait! Tak-a! What are you gonna do?

22:36.730 --> 22:39.232
[boy 1] That punk kid
has some freakin' guts, man.

22:39.316 --> 22:41.485
- I can't believe he came here alone.
- [phone buzzing]

22:41.568 --> 22:42.944
[Dong-ha] Hey, Baek-jin-a.

22:44.112 --> 22:45.906
Yeah. Yeah, uh-huh.

22:48.200 --> 22:49.534
[chuckling]

22:50.786 --> 22:52.079
Okay, got it.

22:54.748 --> 22:55.665
Let's go.

22:58.377 --> 22:59.336
Hey, let's go.

22:59.920 --> 23:02.089
- Hey, keep watch, all right?
- [boys] Yes.

23:02.839 --> 23:05.258
[boy 1] What about her?
She was here yesterday.

23:05.342 --> 23:07.552
- [Dong-ha] Baek-jin will be here soon.
- [boy 2] She's hot.

23:07.636 --> 23:09.304
[boy 3] She's nothin' special, bro.

23:13.225 --> 23:15.852
[Gotak grunts] Bro, you need
to lose some weight.

23:15.936 --> 23:17.521
- [Jun-tae] Ooh, ooh. Wait.
- Can you do it?

23:19.815 --> 23:21.691
Oh! I got it! I did it!

23:23.026 --> 23:24.986
- [gasps]
- [Gotak] Hey, are you okay?

23:26.696 --> 23:27.781
- Comin' in.
- Okay.

23:27.906 --> 23:29.699
[tense music playing]

23:29.783 --> 23:31.576
- [Jun-tae] Whoa! Ah.
- [Gotak gasps]

23:35.288 --> 23:37.624
[Jun-tae gasps] What are all these?

23:40.710 --> 23:42.212
[Gotak] Oh shit.

23:44.506 --> 23:46.299
- Go check up there.
- [Jun-tae] Huh?

23:49.177 --> 23:50.220
[Gotak] Hey, Baku.

23:51.096 --> 23:51.930
Park Hu-min!

23:56.393 --> 23:58.353
[Jun-tae] Tak-a, he's not over here.

23:59.146 --> 24:00.230
Whoa!

24:00.313 --> 24:02.107
- Those are Baku's trunks.
- [Jun-tae] Huh?

24:02.190 --> 24:03.692
- What?
- [Gotak] The tiger trunks. There.

24:04.359 --> 24:05.902
- What?
- [Gotak] Baku's trunks.

24:05.986 --> 24:09.322
- Those are his?
- Yeah, yeah, yeah. They are! Well, shit.

24:12.075 --> 24:13.201
[sighs]

24:13.785 --> 24:15.579
- So he really was here.
- Tak-a.

24:16.121 --> 24:17.247
- Tak-a.
- What, what, what?

24:17.330 --> 24:18.707
Look at the stack of papers.

24:19.291 --> 24:21.376
Is that the stuff Choi Hyo-man mentioned?

24:21.460 --> 24:24.379
The list of crimes Na Baek-jin
committed or something.

24:25.881 --> 24:28.508
Oh. Yeah, man, I think you're right.

24:29.676 --> 24:31.178
- [sighs]
- [Gotak] Hey, Jun-tae-ya.

24:31.261 --> 24:33.096
- Yeah?
- [Gotak] I can't skip on this.

24:38.059 --> 24:39.394
[gasps]

24:40.645 --> 24:41.563
[Jun-tae] What?

24:42.772 --> 24:44.566
- [Gotak] Can you move to the side?
- Wait…

24:44.649 --> 24:46.443
- [Gotak] Hey, we have to look.
- But this isn't…

24:46.526 --> 24:47.777
- It's okay.
- [Jun-tae] Hey!

24:54.659 --> 24:56.077
[silence]

24:56.912 --> 24:58.914
[footsteps coming downstairs]

25:03.543 --> 25:05.378
- [boy 1] Welcome, hyeong.
- [boy 2] Welcome back.

25:05.879 --> 25:07.422
- [Baek-jin] Leave us.
- [boy 1] Yes.

25:12.594 --> 25:14.304
[suspenseful music plays]

25:21.937 --> 25:23.104
[Baek-jin sighs]

25:27.484 --> 25:29.361
I thought we'd never meet again.

25:33.657 --> 25:35.700
There's something I couldn't understand.

25:37.661 --> 25:41.581
I thought there had to be some reason
that a top student like you,

25:42.082 --> 25:45.168
with all your scholarships,
would make money illegally,

25:46.878 --> 25:48.922
by forming the Union and whatever else.

25:51.716 --> 25:53.885
I don't know what that reason might be,

25:56.221 --> 25:58.014
but Hu-min does, doesn't he?

26:00.100 --> 26:01.101
[scoffs]

26:03.186 --> 26:06.064
Are you implying
that Baku knows my secret,

26:07.190 --> 26:09.693
and I'm only doing this
because I'm scared of that?

26:11.152 --> 26:12.279
[Si-eun] No.

26:13.363 --> 26:16.157
Hu-min's the only one
who knows everything about you.

26:17.909 --> 26:19.995
So you think of him as your only friend.

26:25.250 --> 26:26.334
But…

26:29.212 --> 26:31.506
would Baku even think
of you as his friend?

26:38.013 --> 26:39.598
[sighs]

26:54.362 --> 26:57.157
[Baek-jin] My boys will be there soon.

26:59.618 --> 27:00.827
[sighs]

27:03.288 --> 27:05.999
You said to separate the variable
first to solve it.

27:08.585 --> 27:10.754
But I found an even better way than that.

27:16.551 --> 27:18.303
You get rid of the variable.

27:19.846 --> 27:21.139
It's much faster.

27:33.818 --> 27:37.155
Do you remember? Last time,
Baku came all the way to save you guys.

27:38.448 --> 27:40.075
You think you can do the same?

27:45.830 --> 27:47.082
- [pen clatters]
- [gasps]

27:47.916 --> 27:49.209
[breathing shakily]

27:51.544 --> 27:52.545
What?

27:54.464 --> 27:55.840
Are you scared?

28:03.973 --> 28:05.725
[footsteps]

28:08.687 --> 28:10.689
[music fades]

28:12.941 --> 28:14.025
Why are you here?

28:16.194 --> 28:17.570
[yells] What are you doing?

28:22.117 --> 28:23.159
Let's go.

28:24.327 --> 28:25.870
[running footsteps receding]

28:28.373 --> 28:31.876
A-PLUS BOWLING CLUB

28:33.586 --> 28:35.588
[yells] Why the hell would you come here?

28:41.511 --> 28:45.140
Hyun-tak and Jun-tae,
they're at Daesung Motorcycle.

28:45.223 --> 28:47.058
The Union guys just went there too.

28:47.600 --> 28:49.018
We better hurry.

28:54.399 --> 28:56.151
Aah! Fuck, man!

28:56.234 --> 28:57.360
[panting]

28:58.361 --> 28:59.946
[gasps]

29:02.323 --> 29:03.616
[Baek-jin] Park Hu-min.

29:08.830 --> 29:10.832
[suspenseful music playing]

29:14.669 --> 29:16.337
Yeon Si-eun, get outta here.

29:23.052 --> 29:24.929
I'll be fine. Just get out of here.

29:28.349 --> 29:29.809
[breathing unsteadily]

29:45.533 --> 29:46.910
Where's the stuff?

29:49.037 --> 29:50.663
- [Baku] Stuff?
- [jacket creaking]

29:52.957 --> 29:54.042
That bike?

29:56.252 --> 29:57.670
I left it where it was.

29:59.380 --> 30:01.925
Do whatever you want
to the people in my life.

30:03.384 --> 30:04.385
What?

30:05.595 --> 30:08.389
Do all the shit you want. All by yourself.

30:11.309 --> 30:13.019
It's about time I realized…

30:15.146 --> 30:17.398
that you and I will never get along.

30:18.733 --> 30:19.734
So…

30:23.112 --> 30:25.323
just please never contact me again.

30:27.826 --> 30:30.119
We'll be strangers
for the rest of our lives.

30:33.039 --> 30:34.082
[gasps]

30:35.542 --> 30:37.544
[music intensifying]

30:44.384 --> 30:46.010
[panting]

30:46.094 --> 30:47.595
[music quietens]

30:48.513 --> 30:49.556
[Baku] Take care.

30:51.850 --> 30:52.851
[sighs]

31:07.615 --> 31:10.076
- [Gotak] Look for anything.
- [Jun-tae] Yeah, okay.

31:10.660 --> 31:12.579
Do you actually think
we'll find something?

31:12.662 --> 31:13.746
[Gotak] Not this…

31:15.874 --> 31:16.833
Shit.

31:17.333 --> 31:19.085
[tense music playing]

31:27.135 --> 31:28.428
BIKE PURCHASE RECORD

31:28.511 --> 31:29.387
[Jun-tae] Hey!

31:31.973 --> 31:33.808
DATE, PLATE NUMBER, BUYER
NUMBER OF TIMES SOLD

31:33.892 --> 31:35.852
- I found it.
- Oh, you found it?

31:35.935 --> 31:37.645
- Yeah.
- Oh, let me see.

31:40.315 --> 31:42.859
[Jun-tae] I think this is
the list of the stolen bikes they sold.

31:42.942 --> 31:46.070
Do you think the Union will collapse
if we take this to the police?

31:46.571 --> 31:48.865
Then, Baku's issues will
automatically disappear.

31:50.825 --> 31:52.702
Whoa, shit. Jun!

31:53.536 --> 31:55.038
- [laughs]
- [Jun-tae gasps]

31:55.121 --> 31:57.040
Nice. Hey, take it, take it.

31:57.123 --> 31:59.375
- [Jun-tae] Yeah.
- We better go. We aren't missing anything?

31:59.459 --> 32:00.335
- [Jun-tae] No.
- Okay.

32:01.127 --> 32:02.503
[both panting]

32:03.546 --> 32:04.464
[Jun-tae] What?

32:04.964 --> 32:06.299
- [boy 1] Hyeong.
- What's going on?

32:06.382 --> 32:08.217
[boy 1] These shits
broke in through the window.

32:08.301 --> 32:09.302
[boy 2] Let's go.

32:10.803 --> 32:12.180
[door rolling open]

32:16.017 --> 32:17.602
- [Dong-ha] Close the back door.
- Ah, shit.

32:19.979 --> 32:22.231
Hey, little rats. Did you have fun?

32:23.399 --> 32:25.401
- [laughing]
- [door slams]

32:27.445 --> 32:28.529
Jun-tae, stay out of this.

32:29.322 --> 32:31.783
- [breathing shakily]
- [Dong-ha] What are you doing?

32:33.952 --> 32:34.953
Get them.

32:36.204 --> 32:38.289
- [boy 1] Come here, you son of a bitch!
- [yelling]

32:38.373 --> 32:39.666
[grunting]

32:44.212 --> 32:46.089
- [boy 2] Yes!
- [boy 3] Yah!

32:49.801 --> 32:50.802
Shit.

32:51.469 --> 32:52.553
[yells]

32:52.637 --> 32:53.805
[grunts]

32:53.888 --> 32:55.807
[grunting]

32:57.684 --> 32:59.185
[boys groaning]

33:06.192 --> 33:08.152
[boy 3 gasping]

33:08.236 --> 33:10.196
[Jun-tae gasping]

33:11.864 --> 33:13.032
[groans]

33:13.116 --> 33:14.117
Shit.

33:14.200 --> 33:15.535
[roars]

33:21.708 --> 33:22.750
[scoffs]

33:23.251 --> 33:25.336
Hey, he's that guy, right? Baku's minion.

33:26.963 --> 33:28.089
Go Hyun-tak.

33:29.799 --> 33:31.676
Jun-tae-ya, are you okay?

33:31.759 --> 33:33.302
[groans]

33:38.349 --> 33:40.351
[breathing heavily]

33:44.897 --> 33:46.107
[Gotak] Seong-mok.

33:50.737 --> 33:52.071
[grunting]

33:54.615 --> 33:55.700
[grunts]

33:56.826 --> 33:58.661
Great, this fucker does judo.

33:58.745 --> 34:00.163
[breathes shakily]

34:08.504 --> 34:10.006
[grunts]

34:19.766 --> 34:20.767
[yelps]

34:31.486 --> 34:32.653
- [crunch]
- [groans]

34:33.488 --> 34:35.239
[whimpers]

34:35.323 --> 34:37.450
- [grunts]
- [Dong-ha] Move it. Move!

34:38.868 --> 34:39.994
[Gotak groans]

34:43.206 --> 34:45.708
- [Dong-ha] You fucking little bitch.
- [coughs]

34:45.792 --> 34:47.835
Look how this bastard's staring at me.

34:48.795 --> 34:49.712
[Jun-tae yells]

34:50.546 --> 34:51.631
[groans]

34:53.549 --> 34:55.218
- [gasping]
- [Dong-ha moaning]

35:00.223 --> 35:02.850
Are you okay? [panting]

35:07.939 --> 35:09.524
- Are you all right?
- Yeah.

35:12.026 --> 35:13.152
Oh, fuck.

35:16.739 --> 35:18.074
- Jun-tae-ya.
- Huh?

35:18.157 --> 35:19.492
[Gotak] Stay right behind me.

35:20.034 --> 35:21.869
- Okay.
- Let's get it.

35:22.578 --> 35:24.664
- [yells]
- [Jun-tae gasping]

35:24.747 --> 35:26.124
Run, Jun-tae! Open the door!

35:26.207 --> 35:27.917
- Okay!
- [boy 1] Oh, this crazy asshole.

35:28.000 --> 35:29.460
- Put that down!
- [boy 2] Watch it!

35:29.544 --> 35:32.505
- Hey, hurry up! Hurry and open it!
- [boy 1] They're tryin' to leave!

35:33.297 --> 35:34.966
- Opening…
- [Jun-tae] It's open!

35:35.049 --> 35:37.552
- [boy 2] Watch where you swing that thing!
- [boy 3] Hey, asshole!

35:37.635 --> 35:39.679
- [Gotak] Hey, Jun-tae-ya, run!
- [boy 3] Hey, get them!

35:39.762 --> 35:41.889
- [all yelling]
- [boy 3] Fucking bastard!

35:41.973 --> 35:43.975
[breathing unsteadily]

35:45.685 --> 35:46.769
[dramatic music playing]

35:46.853 --> 35:48.521
- [boy 1] Stop running, assholes!
- Come back!

35:48.604 --> 35:50.773
- [boy 4] Assholes! Stop!
- [boy 5] Fucking little bitches!

35:50.857 --> 35:52.900
- Fucking get back here!
- [boy 4] Stop running!

35:52.984 --> 35:55.361
- Hey, Jun-tae-ya. Run. Run!
- [boy 4] Come here! Faster!

35:57.405 --> 35:59.907
- [boy 4] Those fuckers are so fast!
- [Gotak] What are you doing?

35:59.991 --> 36:01.576
- [boy 5 groaning]
- [boy 4] You asshole!

36:01.659 --> 36:02.910
- [boy 4] Come on!
- [boy 5] Stop!

36:02.994 --> 36:06.038
- Run! Run!
- [boy 4] I'll kill you! Get back here!

36:10.960 --> 36:12.628
[panting]

36:14.755 --> 36:16.757
[phone ringing]

36:23.139 --> 36:24.515
- Hello?
- [woman] Hello?

36:24.599 --> 36:26.267
Is this Yeon Si-eun-ssi's phone?

36:26.350 --> 36:28.227
- [crossing alarm bleeping]
- Yes, that's me.

36:28.728 --> 36:31.105
[woman] I'm calling from
Sungang University Hospital.

36:31.189 --> 36:32.982
Patient Ahn Su-ho
is in critical condition,

36:33.065 --> 36:34.525
but I couldn't reach anyone else,

36:34.609 --> 36:36.903
so I looked at the visitor log
and found your number.

36:39.071 --> 36:40.072
[Si-eun] What?

36:40.698 --> 36:44.368
[woman] Do you know any way to reach out
to his guardian or other family members?

36:45.161 --> 36:46.704
Or are you available to come?

36:48.164 --> 36:50.208
- Hello?
- [truck horn blares]

36:51.584 --> 36:52.668
[woman] Hello?

36:55.796 --> 36:58.382
[horn blaring]

36:58.466 --> 37:00.301
[tires screeching]

37:01.969 --> 37:03.137
[sounds fade]

37:04.138 --> 37:06.140
[unsettling music playing]

38:36.147 --> 38:38.149
[slow instrumental version
of "Hero" playing]

39:39.293 --> 39:41.337
[poignant piano music playing]
